  <diagram id="stage1" name="02 Stage 1 Idea Discovery">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1800" dy="1200" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2400" pageHeight="1600" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="p4-0" />
        <mxCell id="p4-1" parent="p4-0" />
        <mxCell id="p4-start" value="&lt;b&gt;Stage 1 开始&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;每轮迭代的第一步。iteration 1 从 Startup 直接进入；后续轮由 Gate 的 stop_reason=null 进入，iteration 已先加一，source_iteration=iteration−1。" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="760" y="20" width="880" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-input" value="&lt;b&gt;输入&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ROOT/RESEARCH_BRIEF.md（含 /research-setup 写的 Baseline Reproduction 节）；ROOT/research-wiki/query_pack.md（Open Problems 段 = 搜索种子，Failed Ideas 段 = 禁做清单）。&lt;br&gt;iteration ≥ 2 另加上一轮证据：workers/&lt;source_iteration&gt;-auto-review-loop/outputs/final-analysis/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md、final-inputs/EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md、AUTO_REVIEW.md。&lt;br&gt;context：iteration、source_iteration、metric_name/target/direction/tolerance/current/history。" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="150" width="1220" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-manifest" value="&lt;b&gt;写并派发 /idea-discovery&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;文件：workers/&lt;iteration&gt;-idea-discovery/input-manifest.json；output_dir=outputs。&lt;br&gt;派发串必须用 em dash：&lt;code&gt;/idea-discovery — manifest: $WORKER_DIR/input-manifest.json&lt;/code&gt;。ASCII 连字符会让 worker-mode 检测静默失败。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="370" width="1220" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-branch" value="&lt;b&gt;完整 idea 管线，无受约束分支&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;和 /research-pipeline Stage 1 是同一条契约：/research-lit → /idea-creator → /novelty-check → /research-review → /research-refine-pipeline，产出 FINAL_PROPOSAL.md 与 EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md。循环不再削减这条管线；曾经的 metric-gap constrained branch 已删除。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="535" width="1220" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-seed" value="&lt;b&gt;搜索种子来自 problem 实体&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;/idea-creator 读 query_pack 的 Open Problems 段：每行是一个 &lt;code&gt;problem:&lt;slug&gt;&lt;/code&gt; 节点（title + severity + 一句 statement），至多 15 条，全部来自 problems/ 前置字段 status=open 的实体扫描——不是自由文本截断。&lt;br&gt;Phase 7 用 &lt;code&gt;upsert_idea --target-problems problem:root,problem:&lt;slug&gt;&lt;/code&gt; 出生 idea 页并连 addresses 边；outcome 固定 pending，由 /result-to-claim 后改。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="705" width="1220" height="155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-iter1" value="&lt;b&gt;iteration 1 不是特例&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;brief 的 Baseline Reproduction 节给出 baseline 方法、实验代码位置、运行命令、期望指标与容差，外加一句“第一轮必须先复现此 baseline”。idea-creator 把它当作首个（最详细的）候选正常出生进 wiki——只是详细程度不同，流程完全一样。&lt;br&gt;/research-setup 描述这个 baseline，但从不运行它。" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="535" width="500" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-report" value="&lt;b&gt;输出&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;outputs/IDEA_REPORT.md：候选、method review、排序、selected_idea_id。&lt;br&gt;outputs/EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md：Stage 2 的自包含计划（目标、里程碑、命令、dataset/split、seeds、metric、成功阈值、expected artifact）。" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="905" width="1220" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-receipt" value="&lt;b&gt;receipt.dashboard_patch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;primary_output=EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md；patch：best_idea（id/title/metric/iteration）、idea_ids（候选 id 数组）、plan_path（required——Stage 2 的输入就是它）；status=done。" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="1075" width="1220" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-merge" value="&lt;b&gt;主 orchestrator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;dashboard-merge 原子写 best_idea、idea_ids、plan_path、applied_receipts；current_phase 改为 experiment-bridge；不读取 IDEA_REPORT.md 内容，不写 research-wiki。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="1235" width="1220" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-end" value="&lt;b&gt;进入 Stage 2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md 与 IDEA_REPORT.md 一起传给 experiment-bridge" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="850" y="1385" width="700" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p4-1" source="p4-start" target="p4-input">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p4-1" source="p4-input" target="p4-manifest">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p4-1" source="p4-manifest" target="p4-branch">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p4-1" source="p4-branch" target="p4-seed">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p4-1" source="p4-seed" target="p4-report">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p4-1" source="p4-report" target="p4-receipt">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p4-1" source="p4-receipt" target="p4-merge">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p4-1" source="p4-merge" target="p4-end">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4-source" value="源码依据：skills/auto-research-loop/SKILL.md §Stage 1；skills/research-pipeline/SKILL.md §Stage 1；skills/idea-creator/SKILL.md Phase 7。" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1385" width="760" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="phase1" name="03 Stage 2 Experiment Bridge">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1300" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2600" pageHeight="2000" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="p1-0" />
        <mxCell id="p1-1" parent="p1-0" />
        <mxCell id="p1-start" value="&lt;b&gt;Stage 2 开始&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;当前 iteration：ITERATION；目标指标：target_metric / target_unit" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="960" y="20" width="600" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-in" value="&lt;b&gt;输入清单（所有迭代一致）&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;$WORKERS_DIR/&lt;ITERATION&gt;-idea-discovery/outputs/EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md + $WORKERS_DIR/&lt;ITERATION&gt;-idea-discovery/outputs/IDEA_REPORT.md。&lt;br&gt;另传 experiment_skill：.claude/skills/run-&lt;project&gt;-experiment/env.json；context.target_metric、target_unit。" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="135" width="1220" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-manifest" value="&lt;b&gt;写 worker manifest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;文件：.aris/runs/&lt;run_id&gt;/workers/&lt;ITERATION&gt;-experiment-bridge/input-manifest.json。&lt;br&gt;字段：worker=experiment-bridge、iteration、run_id、inputs.experiment_plan/idea_report/experiment_skill、context.target_metric/target_unit、output_dir=.../outputs。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="320" width="1220" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-dispatch" value="&lt;b&gt;子 skill：/experiment-bridge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;调用：mcp__paseo__create_agent；prompt 只给 skill 名 + manifest 路径；provider/mode/thinking 从 run 的 Paseo config；等待通知后读 receipt.json、merge、archive。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="480" width="1220" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-parse" value="&lt;b&gt;1. 解析 EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;读出 run order、dataset/split/task、systems/variants、metrics、backbone/hyperparameters/seeds、success criterion、MUST-RUN/NICE-TO-HAVE、GPU 预算、method。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="635" width="1220" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-code" value="&lt;b&gt;2. 实现实验代码&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;动作：先找并复用现有代码；补训练/评估/data loader/baseline；所有超参 argparse 可配置；固定 seed；结果写 JSON/CSV；按 sanity → baseline → main → ablation 实现。&lt;br&gt;改动：项目实验脚本、配置、日志代码；输入 MD 的每个命令/超参必须能在实现中找到对应字段。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="780" width="1220" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-review-d" value="CODE_REVIEW=true？" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="930" y="960" width="660" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-review" value="&lt;b&gt;子 skill/agent：Codex code review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;读取计划、FINAL_PROPOSAL、实现脚本；检查方法对应关系、超参、loss/data split/eval、真实 ground-truth、OOM/数值稳定/seed。&lt;br&gt;判断：CRITICAL=0 才继续；有 critical → 修复后最多重审 2 轮；create_agent 失败才允许跳过。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1960" y="935" width="590" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-sanity" value="&lt;b&gt;3. SANITY_FIRST：调用 /run-experiment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;先运行最小 sanity 实验；不能在 bridge 进程内 inline 跑。&lt;br&gt;若 generated skill scripts/ 不存在，先调用 /experiment-env-manager mode=setup；等待 receipt。&lt;br&gt;验证：训练无错误、指标保存、GPU 内存、输出格式。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="1150" width="1220" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-sanity-d" value="sanity 成功？" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="930" y="1335" width="660" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-debug" value="&lt;b&gt;失败调试&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;最多 3 次：按 stderr/traceback 分类 OOM、ImportError、路径、CUDA、NaN；修复后重跑；第 2 次起可调用 /codex:rescue；3 次仍失败 → 写 .aris/env-config/&lt;project&gt;/error-reports/&lt;timestamp&gt;.json 并调用 /experiment-env-manager mode=error-report。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1300" width="540" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-route" value="&lt;b&gt;4. 按 job 数量路由部署&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;每个 milestone 依据 plan 的 jobs、multi-seed、phase dependency 判断。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="1525" width="1220" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-route-d" value="≤5 jobs 且无大规模依赖？" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="930" y="1645" width="660" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-run" value="&lt;b&gt;子 skill：/run-experiment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;调用 generated scripts：info.sh → prepare.sh（同步代码）→ run.sh；返回 handle；monitor.sh 验证启动；完成后 collect.sh 获取结果；Vast 配置 auto_destroy=true 时 teardown.sh。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1810" width="540" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-queue" value="&lt;b&gt;子 skill：/experiment-queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;条件：≥10 jobs、multi-seed sweep、teacher→student 依赖或需 wave/OOM 管理。&lt;br&gt;写 experiment-queue/&lt;timestamp&gt;/manifest.json、run_meta.txt；远端持续写 .aris_queue/runs/&lt;timestamp&gt;/queue_state.json；按 expected output 判断完成。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1960" y="1810" width="590" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-monitor" value="&lt;b&gt;子 skill：/monitor-experiment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;读取 monitor.sh JSON：status、gpu_usage、tail、exit_code、elapsed_seconds、wandb；必要时 collect.sh 下载 ./results/*.json 与 ./logs/*。&lt;br&gt;若仍 running：等待外部通知后再监控，不 busy-poll。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="1800" width="1220" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-collect" value="&lt;b&gt;5. 收集并更新 tracker&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;输入：JSON/CSV/log、EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md success criteria。&lt;br&gt;改动：EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md 的 Status/Notes；写初始 EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md，记录每个 milestone、主指标、完成数、positive/negative/inconclusive、是否 ready。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="1985" width="1220" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-analyze" value="&lt;b&gt;5.6 强制子 skill：/analyze-results&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;写 internal/analyze-results/input-manifest.json：results、tracker、experiment_plan、experiment_skill、error_report?、metric_history、output_dir=outputs/analysis。只允许分析本 worker 的结果/Tracker；不能换成项目根 results/logs。&lt;br&gt;验证 receipt：status=done、run/iteration 匹配、analysis/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md 存在、metric.current 有限。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="2160" width="1220" height="155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-analyze-fail" value="分析失败或 verifier 要补充？&lt;br&gt;失败是 experiment-bridge failed；不能退回 raw rows，也不能自动替用户接受 verifier 的 FAIL。" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="910" y="2360" width="700" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-ablation-d" value="主结果 positive？且需要消融？" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="930" y="2550" width="660" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-ablation" value="&lt;b&gt;可选子 skill：/ablation-planner&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;读取主结果、method、claims、硬件；设计 component/hyperparameter/design-choice ablation；把新的 blocks 追加到 refine-logs/EXPERIMENT_PLAN.md 与 EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md。主结果 negative/inconclusive 时跳过。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1960" y="2520" width="590" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-out" value="&lt;b&gt;Stage 2 worker 输出&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;outputs/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md（原始汇总）&lt;br&gt;outputs/EXPERIMENT_TRACKER.md（执行状态）&lt;br&gt;outputs/analysis/EXPERIMENT_RESULTS.md（结构化分析）&lt;br&gt;receipt.json：metric.current、metric.delta、statistical_significance、experiment_ids；experiments[] 每项 slug/title/idea/verdict/confidence/metrics/reasoning/provenance/tags。" style="shape=parallelogram;perimeter=parallelogramPerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="2720" width="1220" height="165" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-merge" value="&lt;b&gt;主 orchestrator 合并&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;dashboard-merge.js apply：校验 receipt/input-manifest/iteration/current_phase/允许 patch；原子更新 dashboard.json；更新 metric.history（同 iteration 的 final analyze 会替换 bridge 的初值，不新增重复行）；追加 applied_receipts；若 has_errors 则累加 system_errors。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="2910" width="1220" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-wiki" value="&lt;b&gt;主 orchestrator 的 canonical wiki 写入&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;逐条读取 receipt.experiments；调用 research-wiki.js add_experiment research-wiki/。写入实验实体字段：slug、title、idea、verdict、confidence、metrics、reasoning、provenance、tags。主 orchestrator 不读 worker 的 raw MD。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="650" y="3080" width="1220" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-end" value="&lt;b&gt;进入 Stage 3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;current_phase=auto-review-loop" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="950" y="3240" width="620" height="75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p1-1" source="p1-start" target="p1-in">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p1-1" source="p1-in" target="p1-manifest">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="p1-1" source="p1-manifest" target="p1-dispatch">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
